# SEO Content Rules

Every public SEO page must have:
- Unique title
- Meta description
- One H1
- Proper H2/H3 structure
- Internal links
- CTA section
- FAQ section where useful
- Clean slug
- Open Graph metadata
- Schema markup where appropriate

Country pages must include:
- Why study in this country
- Tuition cost range
- Living cost range
- Admission requirements
- Language requirements
- Intakes
- Visa process
- Scholarship opportunities
- Popular universities
- FAQ
- Consultation CTA

University pages must include:
- University overview
- Country and city
- Popular courses
- Tuition estimate
- Entry requirements
- Intakes
- Scholarship availability
- Apply/consultation CTA

Blog pages must:
- Solve one clear student problem
- Use simple language
- Include internal links
- Avoid keyword stuffing
- End with consultation CTA

Never create thin pages with only generic text.
